            "review_title": "Review at Ya! Japanese Dining & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Sean\nNha Trang, Vietnam19 contributions\n0\nJapanese curry don’t right\nJun 2025 • Couples\nThis restaurant is my little slice of pie!\n\nI’ve been in Nha Trang 3wks now and I’ve been here like 4x😅 the quality of the meat is amazing, their pork loin cut is to die for. We tried the Tonkatsu curry and the beef udon and yelped with joy.\n\nThe curry quality was flavoured well with the spice being very well balanced. You could tell the Udon broth had been cooked for at least 24hrs, there was this silky smooth texture to the broth which was light but hearty.\n\nI’ll more than likely try and squeeze in a few more visits before I leave😄\nRead more\nWritten June 1, 2025",
